"roidesfoux" <roidesfoux@yahoo.com> writes:

> Does anyone have a spoiler on monsters being immune to damage from
> insufficiently enchanted sources (eg. needs a +2 or better weapon to
> damage it)? I'm playing as a monk, and I could have sworn that the
> enchantment on my gloves counted for my unarmed attack, but it doesn't
> seem to be working always.

I believe that unarmed attacks are treated as though you were wielding
a weapon with enchantment (your level / 4).  E.g. if the monster needs
a +2 or better weapon to damage it, you'll be able to damage it once
you reach level 8.  Vecna needs a +4 weapon or a level 16 unarmed
attack to damage him - I believe that this is the highest enchantment
required.
Eva.

